{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"301","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Yaroslav and Time"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yaroslav is playing a game called \"Time\". The game has a timer showing the lifespan he's got left. As soon as the timer shows 0, Yaroslav's character dies and the game ends. Also, the game has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" clock stations, station number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" is at point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(xi, yi)"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the plane. As the player visits station number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":", he increases the current time on his timer by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":". The stations are for one-time use only, so if the player visits some station another time, the time on his timer won't grow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A player spends "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d·dist"},{"kind":"text","text":" time units to move between stations, where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dist"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the distance the player has covered and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" is some constant. The distance between stations "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" is determined as "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|xi - xj| + |yi - yj|"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially, the player is at station number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the player has strictly more than zero and strictly less than one units of time. At station number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" one unit of money can increase the time on the timer by one time unit (you can buy only integer number of time units)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now Yaroslav is wondering, how much money he needs to get to station "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". Help Yaroslav. Consider the time to buy and to increase the timer value negligibly small."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(3 ≤ n ≤ 100, 103 ≤ d ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of stations and the constant from the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2, a3, ..., an - 1"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ ai ≤ 103)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the coordinates of the stations. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"("},{"kind":"text","text":"-"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100 ≤ xi, yi ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no two stations are located at the same point."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In a single line print an integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 1000\n1000\n0 0\n0 1\n0 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 1000\n1000\n1 0\n1 1\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"301B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/301/problem/B"}